As it stands

A payer audit letter from Dennis O'Shields (A18) flags that one provider's group NPI on file doesn't match Coopa Blue's current organizational identifier — but deliberately doesn't say what the right value is. The agent has to go find it.

How it resolves

Dr. Melissa Prentiss's CAQH profile history (A20) shows exactly one entry, dated 02/27/2025 — four days before the acquisition closed — still carrying Winston's legacy group NPI 1342281246, and nothing since. That's 410 days stale at the anchor. The correct current value, 1384970290, lives only in the Enrollment Reference Sheet (A19). The agent corrects her attribute in OpenMRS and confirms via Metabase that no one else is affected — unlike T5, this one really is isolated.

